<office:body><office:text>
<text:p text:style-name="Title">Nested lists</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Label">Mixed nesting: numbers, then letters, roman numerals or bullets.</text:p><text:list text:style-name="LNum"><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="List_20_Contents">Prepare the site</text:p><text:list text:style-name="LAlpha"><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="List_20_Contents">Erect the hoarding</text:p><text:list text:style-name="LRoman"><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="List_20_Contents">Set out the line</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="List_20_Contents">Fix the posts at 2.4 m centres</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="List_20_Contents">Hang the panels</text:p></text:list-item></text:list></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="List_20_Contents">Install the welfare unit</text:p><text:list text:style-name="LBullet"><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="List_20_Contents">Connect water</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="List_20_Contents">Connect power</text:p></text:list-item></text:list></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="List_20_Contents">Agree the traffic plan</text:p></text:list-item></text:list></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="List_20_Contents">Demolish the extension</text:p><text:list text:style-name="LBullet"><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="List_20_Contents">Strip out the fittings</text:p><text:list text:style-name="LRoman"><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="List_20_Contents">Kitchen units</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="List_20_Contents">Sanitaryware</text:p></text:list-item></text:list></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="List_20_Contents">Take down the roof</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="List_20_Contents">Break out the slab</text:p></text:list-item></text:list></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="List_20_Contents">Build the new structure</text:p><text:list text:style-name="LAlpha"><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="List_20_Contents">Foundations</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="List_20_Contents">Frame</text:p><text:list text:style-name="LBullet"><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="List_20_Contents">Columns</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="List_20_Contents">Beams</text:p></text:list-item></text:list></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="List_20_Contents">Envelope</text:p></text:list-item></text:list></text:list-item></text:list><text:p text:style-name="Label">Outline numbering 1. a. i.</text:p><text:list text:style-name="LMulti"><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="List_20_Contents">Prepare the site</text:p><text:list text:style-name="LMulti"><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="List_20_Contents">Erect the hoarding</text:p><text:list text:style-name="LMulti"><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="List_20_Contents">Set out the line</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="List_20_Contents">Fix the posts at 2.4 m centres</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="List_20_Contents">Hang the panels</text:p></text:list-item></text:list></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="List_20_Contents">Install the welfare unit</text:p><text:list text:style-name="LMulti"><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="List_20_Contents">Connect water</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="List_20_Contents">Connect power</text:p></text:list-item></text:list></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="List_20_Contents">Agree the traffic plan</text:p></text:list-item></text:list></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="List_20_Contents">Demolish the extension</text:p><text:list text:style-name="LMulti"><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="List_20_Contents">Strip out the fittings</text:p><text:list text:style-name="LMulti"><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="List_20_Contents">Kitchen units</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="List_20_Contents">Sanitaryware</text:p></text:list-item></text:list></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="List_20_Contents">Take down the roof</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="List_20_Contents">Break out the slab</text:p></text:list-item></text:list></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="List_20_Contents">Build the new structure</text:p><text:list text:style-name="LMulti"><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="List_20_Contents">Foundations</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="List_20_Contents">Frame</text:p><text:list text:style-name="LMulti"><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="List_20_Contents">Columns</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="List_20_Contents">Beams</text:p></text:list-item></text:list></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="List_20_Contents">Envelope</text:p></text:list-item></text:list></text:list-item></text:list><text:p text:style-name="Text_20_body">Where the drawings and the specification disagree, the contractor must ask the contract administrator for an instruction. Work that starts before the instruction is at the contractor's own risk.</text:p>
